{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OpaqueEnrollment"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The server cannot build this — it never sees the plaintext — so any request that "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"sets","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"password has to carry it: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/auth\/password\/change"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/auth\/reset\/confirm"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/admin\/bootstrap"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note what is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" here. The SRP enrolment this replaces carried a salt, a group and a full set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of KDF costs, and required the account’s canonical username — passing an email produced a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verifier no login could ever satisfy, and renaming a user invalidated their verifier outright."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A record binds to a credential identifier the server chooses, and the key-stretching parameters"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are the server’s, so there is nothing here a caller can get wrong."}]}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"OpaqueEnrollment","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK16OpaqueEnrollmentV"